WEBVTT

00:01.060 --> 00:02.880
I want to learn lots of things

00:02.880 --> 00:04.670
and help people in need.

00:04.970 --> 00:07.340
I want to meet all kinds of people.

00:07.650 --> 00:09.820
So...

00:09.820 --> 00:12.200
In order to protect all of your smiles...

00:13.500 --> 00:15.470
I want to be an adventurer!

00:16.920 --> 00:21.130
Cain, you'll need to study
a lot more to achieve that.

00:21.130 --> 00:24.330
Very well. I'll arrange a tutor for you.

00:24.590 --> 00:27.310
Wow! Really, Father?!

00:27.310 --> 00:29.560
Good for you, Master Cain!

00:29.560 --> 00:30.520
Yeah!

00:32.060 --> 00:33.790
I'm so excited!

00:33.790 --> 00:35.640
What will my tutor be like?

00:35.640 --> 00:36.690
Ripped?

00:36.690 --> 00:38.060
Or more like a witch?

00:38.060 --> 00:40.050
Or maybe... Could it actually be?!

00:40.050 --> 00:40.790
Master Cain, your tutor has arrived.
Or maybe... Could it actually be?!

00:40.790 --> 00:43.140
Master Cain, your tutor has arrived.

00:46.090 --> 00:47.030
Move!

00:47.490 --> 00:49.590
Wha... Wh-Whoa!

00:50.780 --> 00:53.050
There's a boy falling from the sky.

01:00.550 --> 01:03.320
Do you want to nurse, little boy?

01:03.320 --> 01:04.840
I don't have any milk yet...

01:05.300 --> 01:07.020
I'm sorry! I'm so sorry!

01:07.480 --> 01:08.680
I will introduce you.

01:09.050 --> 01:12.150
These are your tutors,
Maestra Millie and Maestra Nina.

01:13.980 --> 01:15.730
Oh, man, I screwed up bad!

01:16.110 --> 01:19.310
My name is Cain von Silford...

01:19.870 --> 01:21.570
I'm... Cain.

01:22.430 --> 01:26.730
But the truth is, I reincarnated
in this world as a noble.

01:27.100 --> 01:30.270
For some reason, though, the gods
gave me level-10 protections,

01:30.270 --> 01:32.310
so my status is off the charts.

01:32.870 --> 01:37.000
But that's a secret to everyone!

03:09.110 --> 03:13.270
I-I'll be your tutor starting today...

03:14.010 --> 03:16.910
D-Don't mind if I do!
I'm Millie the aveshurer!

03:16.910 --> 03:20.300
Millie... D-rank. H'lo.

03:20.300 --> 03:22.080
Nina. Pleasure.

03:22.080 --> 03:24.630
Hey! Don't be rude to the nobles!

03:24.890 --> 03:26.670
Wow! An elf!

03:26.950 --> 03:29.160
Honestly, why are you so
shy around strangers?

03:29.160 --> 03:32.130
It's all right. You two are
his tutors, after all.

03:32.130 --> 03:33.290
Right, Cain?

03:33.290 --> 03:36.150
Yes. You don't need to speak politely to me.

03:37.210 --> 03:39.480
I'm so glad to hear you say that!

03:39.480 --> 03:43.460
You'll teach him for three years.
Do take good care of Cain.

03:44.030 --> 03:45.190
Let's get along, okay?

03:45.190 --> 03:45.990
Let's.

03:46.320 --> 03:48.610
Well, let's get started right away!

03:49.220 --> 03:51.200
We'll start with swordsmanship.

03:51.200 --> 03:53.370
Try some swings, and we'll watch you.

03:58.830 --> 04:00.990
H-How is he so good?

04:00.990 --> 04:03.300
He might be even better than you.

04:03.530 --> 04:06.640
Hey! I wouldn't lose to a five-year-old!

04:06.640 --> 04:09.950
Okay, Cain, if you can do all that,
we can have a mock battle.

04:09.950 --> 04:10.890
Give me all you've got.

04:11.170 --> 04:12.320
Got it!

04:14.230 --> 04:16.290
Cain, are you really five years old?!

04:16.290 --> 04:19.530
Yes. I just underwent my
baptism the other day.

04:19.530 --> 04:20.210
What?!

04:20.210 --> 04:21.230
Unbelievable...

04:21.410 --> 04:21.980
Here I go!

04:22.910 --> 04:25.100
That keen swordsmanship...

04:25.100 --> 04:28.130
Cain, by any chance, do you have
the protection of the God of War?

04:28.130 --> 04:32.640
Yes, though my father said not to
tell anyone outside my family.

04:32.640 --> 04:34.990
Stop! Stop, stop!

04:34.990 --> 04:37.680
I'll never last if we keep up this pace!

04:37.680 --> 04:40.940
Get Nina to start teaching you magic now.

04:40.940 --> 04:43.200
And on that note... it's break time.

04:44.340 --> 04:46.980
You're all Nina's now.

04:46.980 --> 04:48.620
Okay, I'm on it.

04:48.870 --> 04:51.980
I have level-3 protection
from the God of Magic.

04:51.980 --> 04:53.220
We'll start with the basics.

04:53.220 --> 04:55.890
Oh, I've already learned all that.

04:55.890 --> 04:57.520
I practiced what I read in books.

04:57.520 --> 04:58.280
Books?

04:58.280 --> 04:59.990
Yes. Watch this.

04:59.990 --> 05:01.220
Water Ball!

05:01.600 --> 05:02.930
Fire Ball!

05:03.540 --> 05:04.690
Rock Bullet!

05:04.690 --> 05:05.410
Huh?!

05:08.360 --> 05:11.140
It's all beginner-level, though,
so that's about all I can do.

05:12.730 --> 05:14.440
Unchanted magic...

05:14.440 --> 05:18.410
But just using shortened forms of
incantations takes intense training...

05:18.410 --> 05:21.570
Unchanted magic at age five? He's a genius.

05:21.570 --> 05:24.310
And he has all the elements, no less.

05:24.310 --> 05:25.380
Impossible!

05:25.770 --> 05:28.100
Even among palace mages of the sage class,

05:28.100 --> 05:30.610
there's no one who can use all the elements.

05:30.610 --> 05:33.010
And with such power!

05:33.360 --> 05:36.840
Cain, do you have protection
from the God of Magic, too?

05:36.840 --> 05:37.530
Yes.

05:37.530 --> 05:39.880
You have two protections? Swordsmanship...

05:39.880 --> 05:40.350
Yes.

05:40.350 --> 05:41.270
...and magic?

05:41.270 --> 05:41.720
Yep.

05:41.720 --> 05:44.260
There might not be anything
we can teach him!

05:44.260 --> 05:46.230
Oh, Maestra, here's a towel.

05:46.230 --> 05:47.310
Huh?!

05:47.310 --> 05:49.030
Th-That's...

05:49.030 --> 05:51.380
Item Box!

05:51.760 --> 05:54.630
Nothing's going to surprise me anymore.

05:55.000 --> 05:57.620
If I'm shocked by everything
he does, it'll never end.

05:57.620 --> 06:00.080
Cain... You're a genius.

06:00.420 --> 06:02.830
We can't teach him here anymore.

06:02.830 --> 06:05.050
The place won't last against his power.

06:05.050 --> 06:09.010
Then, could you please
give me lessons outside?

06:09.010 --> 06:10.320
Outside?

06:10.320 --> 06:16.940
Yes. I've actually never left the
mansion, except for my baptism.

06:16.940 --> 06:21.050
So if you could take me outside
for the sake of magic practice...

06:21.050 --> 06:22.470
He has a point.

06:22.470 --> 06:26.230
With his talent, it might be
better to practice outside.

06:26.550 --> 06:28.940
Yeah. You're strong, Cain.

06:28.940 --> 06:30.540
You mean...

06:30.830 --> 06:33.120
We'll need to convince your father first.

06:33.770 --> 06:38.020
You're saying you can't train
Cain here at the mansion?

06:38.020 --> 06:40.870
Yes. Even though he's only five years old,

06:40.870 --> 06:44.080
he's far surpassed the beginner level
in both swordsmanship and magic.

06:44.080 --> 06:46.160
If we teach him at an intermediate level...

06:47.220 --> 06:49.160
He'll destroy the mansion.

06:51.560 --> 06:54.850
I figured it would come to this eventually,

06:54.850 --> 06:56.940
but on the very first day?

06:56.940 --> 07:00.620
That's amazing, Cain!
It's easy to see you're my son!

07:00.620 --> 07:06.110
So, my lord, we would like to continue
his training outside the mansion.

07:06.110 --> 07:08.070
Very well, but...

07:08.070 --> 07:09.390
But?

07:09.390 --> 07:11.970
You must return before sundown.

07:11.970 --> 07:15.710
Do not go far.
And above all, know your limits!

07:15.710 --> 07:17.290
Understand, Cain?

07:18.110 --> 07:18.970
Yes!

07:26.910 --> 07:28.340
So this is the outside!

07:28.340 --> 07:30.300
The world of adventuring!

07:30.300 --> 07:33.510
Okay, Cain, we're far enough
from the mansion now.

07:33.770 --> 07:35.270
Nina, he's all yours.

07:35.690 --> 07:36.540
I'm on it.

07:37.240 --> 07:40.640
Cain, try intermediate-level magic.

07:40.950 --> 07:44.280
All right. I'll try it with fire first.

07:44.280 --> 07:45.570
Fire...

07:46.320 --> 07:47.490
Wall!

07:56.970 --> 07:59.960
Maestra, I think I went overboard.

07:59.960 --> 08:02.410
That's way beyond intermediate...

08:02.410 --> 08:06.300
Using that much power should have
drained a ton of your magic.

08:06.300 --> 08:07.370
You don't feel tired?

08:07.630 --> 08:09.830
No problems at all!

08:09.830 --> 08:12.610
H-He has an insane amount of magic, too!

08:12.610 --> 08:13.760
Who <i>is</i> this kid?!

08:14.160 --> 08:15.630
I'm Cain!

08:17.150 --> 08:19.300
Be quiet for a second. Nina...

08:19.300 --> 08:20.220
I know.

08:20.220 --> 08:20.980
Be alert.

08:22.410 --> 08:23.310
Something's coming.

08:26.520 --> 08:28.110
A killer rabbit.

08:28.110 --> 08:29.980
It's a dangerous monster
that attacks people.

08:33.030 --> 08:33.690
Cain!

08:35.190 --> 08:36.490
Air Bullet!

08:37.470 --> 08:40.560
Congrats. That's your first kill.

08:40.560 --> 08:42.950
What do you want to do with it?
You could sell the meat and hide.

08:42.950 --> 08:46.620
Actually, I want to show it
to my mother and my sister.

08:50.770 --> 08:52.380
That's so cool!

08:52.380 --> 08:55.220
I'm planning to buy a Magic Bag
when I have enough saved up, too.

08:55.530 --> 08:56.930
Magic Bag?

08:57.280 --> 08:59.100
A magic item.

08:59.100 --> 09:01.930
It does the same thing as Item Box,
even if you don't have the skill.

09:01.930 --> 09:03.400
They're pricey, though.

09:03.400 --> 09:05.010
A Magic Bag, huh?

09:05.340 --> 09:08.830
Anyway, we have time.
Why don't we hunt some more?

09:09.230 --> 09:11.410
Nina, could you use Search?

09:11.410 --> 09:13.110
Yep, I'm on it.

09:13.930 --> 09:17.760
I seek. Find the enemies
that surround mine self.

09:17.760 --> 09:18.830
Search!

09:20.060 --> 09:20.830
There.

09:21.130 --> 09:23.730
A few of them, 300 meters ahead.

09:24.580 --> 09:27.700
Maestra Nina, how did you use that magic?

09:28.350 --> 09:31.210
I searched for the monsters' magic.

09:31.210 --> 09:34.000
I sort of just spread my own
magic out in a thin layer.

09:34.730 --> 09:35.710
Like this?

09:36.140 --> 09:39.490
I seek. Find the enemies
that surround mine self.

09:39.490 --> 09:40.320
Search!

09:44.670 --> 09:48.640
You're right! There are four killer
rabbits, 300 meters ahead.

09:48.910 --> 09:51.660
What? Not many people can
do that on the first try!

09:51.660 --> 09:53.840
And you even got the
specific number of them...

09:53.840 --> 09:55.070
Are you really five?

09:55.340 --> 09:56.380
That way!

09:56.380 --> 09:57.550
Nina...

09:57.550 --> 10:00.060
With Cain, it's important
to know when to give up.

10:06.330 --> 10:07.900
Air Bullet!

10:08.660 --> 10:09.910
You're not getting away!

10:09.910 --> 10:11.250
Cain, stop!

10:12.700 --> 10:14.140
Don't go in there.

10:14.140 --> 10:19.140
That's a very dangerous forest
where strong monsters live.

10:19.140 --> 10:21.080
Strong monsters?

10:21.080 --> 10:24.100
Yes. Once every few decades...

10:24.800 --> 10:29.180
they stage an outbreak on the city en masse.

10:30.260 --> 10:33.550
I see. So that's why the
city wall is so well fortified.

10:33.550 --> 10:36.410
It's to protect everyone from monsters.

10:38.770 --> 10:41.490
You'd better become a
strong adventurer, too,

10:41.910 --> 10:45.410
so you can protect the city
when the time comes, okay?

10:45.660 --> 10:48.180
Right! I will, Maestra!

10:49.340 --> 10:50.390
Someday...

10:51.340 --> 10:52.350
I'll also...

10:53.630 --> 10:56.330
What?! Level 8?!

10:56.330 --> 11:00.320
I leveled up that much just by
beating a few killer rabbits?!

11:00.320 --> 11:01.550
How?!

11:04.680 --> 11:07.290
An increase of 100x?!

11:07.290 --> 11:10.390
That's it! That's why that happened!

11:10.660 --> 11:13.600
That's obviously beyond human capability!

11:13.940 --> 11:16.700
If people find out about
this ridiculous status...

11:16.700 --> 11:21.880
Forget state supervision!
I'd be hunted down and eliminated!

11:21.880 --> 11:28.000
No way! I just want to have fun adventuring
without a care in this world!

11:28.000 --> 11:32.710
Ugh! You stupid gods!

11:42.750 --> 11:43.350
Huh?

11:43.590 --> 11:45.760
The gate is this way, Maestras.

11:46.150 --> 11:50.240
We think you'll be okay fighting
monsters that are a little stronger,

11:50.240 --> 11:53.560
so we thought we'd stop by the guild
and get some info on monsters.

11:53.870 --> 11:55.510
The guild?!

11:55.510 --> 11:58.520
You definitely can't be an adventurer
without a guild, right?!

11:58.520 --> 12:00.990
What's wrong, Cain? Let's go.

12:00.990 --> 12:01.720
Right!

12:07.320 --> 12:09.050
So this is the guild!

12:09.050 --> 12:10.320
Cain!

12:10.320 --> 12:12.040
I'm coming!

12:12.040 --> 12:13.740
Rudy, got a sec?

12:13.740 --> 12:14.560
Sure!

12:14.560 --> 12:17.180
Wow, dog ears!

12:17.180 --> 12:18.540
What brings you here today?

12:18.540 --> 12:21.170
We wanted some information on monsters.

12:21.170 --> 12:23.680
Is there anything stronger
than killer rabbits?

12:23.680 --> 12:26.970
Hmm... I think all we've
got right now is wolves.

12:26.970 --> 12:31.270
Let's see... I haven't gotten
any new witness reports.

12:31.270 --> 12:35.280
Wolves, huh? We don't want a whole
pack of them coming at us, but...

12:35.670 --> 12:37.190
They should be perfect for Cain.

12:37.190 --> 12:38.560
Oh, for this little boy?

12:38.950 --> 12:42.180
You're an awfully cute adventurer.
How old are you?

12:42.180 --> 12:43.280
Oh, um...

12:43.280 --> 12:47.120
He's the son of the domain lord.

12:47.120 --> 12:49.700
What?! P-Please forgive me!

12:49.700 --> 12:52.280
I'm Rudy, the guild receptionist!

12:52.280 --> 12:54.630
I'm Cain von Silford.

12:55.220 --> 12:59.580
I'm only five years old,
so I can't register yet,

12:59.580 --> 13:01.250
but thank you for having me!

13:01.480 --> 13:04.500
I can tell you're a noble! You're so polite!

13:04.500 --> 13:05.090
Oh?

13:05.700 --> 13:07.310
Well, look who it is.

13:07.620 --> 13:12.470
What's a D-rank duo like you
doing with a little kid?

13:12.470 --> 13:15.920
Are babysitting quests the only
ones you can get anymore?

13:17.470 --> 13:18.010
Let's go.

13:18.010 --> 13:22.490
Hold it. Ditch the kid and
pour me a drink, D-rank.

13:22.490 --> 13:24.890
Try going to a bar where
they do that kind of thing.

13:24.890 --> 13:27.990
We're on duty right now.

13:27.990 --> 13:30.200
Do my ears deceive me?!

13:30.200 --> 13:34.300
Did a D-rank just say that
to me, Crosse, a C-rank?!

13:34.300 --> 13:38.110
Do what your superior says
and pour me a drink already!

13:38.110 --> 13:39.000
Nina!

13:39.000 --> 13:39.920
Whoa, there.

13:39.920 --> 13:41.330
You're coming, too.

13:41.660 --> 13:42.270
Nina!

13:45.440 --> 13:50.010
I'm sorry, but I need to train.
Could you not interfere?

13:50.010 --> 13:51.420
And just who are you?

13:51.650 --> 13:52.850
I'm Cain.

13:52.850 --> 13:56.160
Maestra Millie and
Maestra Nina's student,

13:56.800 --> 13:57.900
Cain!

13:58.200 --> 13:59.770
Cain, run!

13:59.770 --> 14:01.510
Don't come with us.

14:01.510 --> 14:05.330
They may tell me to run,
but we have training to get to,

14:05.330 --> 14:06.880
so please get out of our way!

14:07.400 --> 14:09.360
Ow!

14:10.270 --> 14:14.000
You little brat! I'll teach you a lesson!

14:16.370 --> 14:18.490
Who the hell are you?!

14:18.490 --> 14:21.210
A high school student—I mean, I'm Cain.

14:21.450 --> 14:24.290
Garm von Silford, the margrave, is my—

14:24.290 --> 14:26.550
Quit your babbling!

14:28.520 --> 14:29.250
You little...

14:30.660 --> 14:31.560
Cain!

14:32.040 --> 14:34.930
You drew that. You drew a blade.

14:36.210 --> 14:38.000
So what if I did?!

14:40.060 --> 14:41.770
I won't allow that!

14:41.770 --> 14:43.580
Apologize to my maestras!

14:43.580 --> 14:44.800
Shut up!

14:44.800 --> 14:47.490
Very well. If that's how
you're going to be...

14:55.840 --> 14:57.340
And what about you two?

14:57.340 --> 14:58.360
Just try it!

14:58.360 --> 15:00.730
If you don't care what
happens to her, that is!

15:01.390 --> 15:02.930
You guys also get...

15:03.340 --> 15:05.620
a good spanking!

15:08.380 --> 15:09.940
Cain...

15:10.590 --> 15:12.120
Maestra Nina...

15:12.470 --> 15:15.310
Thank you for protecting us.

15:15.670 --> 15:18.500
Next time, I'll protect you.

15:19.150 --> 15:20.600
Maestra Nina...

15:20.600 --> 15:23.970
Cain! You're not just good
with the sword and magic!

15:23.970 --> 15:25.680
You can do martial arts, too!

15:25.680 --> 15:26.270
Yes.

15:26.740 --> 15:30.140
I studied it in books.

15:33.870 --> 15:36.590
Okay, let's head to the forest!

15:36.590 --> 15:38.240
Fire Wall!

15:38.240 --> 15:39.950
Water Ball!

15:39.950 --> 15:41.330
Rock Bullet!

15:53.060 --> 15:55.760
Welcome back, Master Cain!

15:56.510 --> 15:58.760
I've prepared a change of clothes for you.

15:59.680 --> 16:02.110
Thank you, Sylvia.

16:02.480 --> 16:08.810
Both of your tutors just declined to
extend the duration of their contract.

16:10.560 --> 16:11.520
I see.

16:11.760 --> 16:14.350
Shall I have Lord Garm
ask them to reconsider?

16:14.350 --> 16:15.410
No.

16:15.750 --> 16:18.820
I can't tie down two
adventurers for too long.

16:19.300 --> 16:22.630
I wonder if there's any
way I can thank them.

16:23.050 --> 16:26.100
They've been so good to
me these past three years.

16:26.100 --> 16:29.170
Is there anything they want?

16:29.810 --> 16:31.220
Oh, I know!

16:31.220 --> 16:35.040
Maestra Millie once said
that she wanted a Magic Bag!

16:35.280 --> 16:36.440
In that case...

16:39.930 --> 16:42.180
I'll need materials from monsters!

16:42.510 --> 16:45.600
I think a red bag would suit
Maestra Millie best, so...

16:45.600 --> 16:46.450
There's one!

16:46.850 --> 16:48.370
A blood ogre!

16:49.890 --> 16:50.500
Huh?!

16:51.430 --> 16:54.770
Okay! And I think Maestra Nina
would like green...

16:55.090 --> 16:56.380
Oh, there's one!

16:56.710 --> 16:58.180
An earth dragon!

17:00.040 --> 17:01.860
Whoa! That's bad news!

17:03.220 --> 17:05.750
It's... a monster outbreak!

17:06.170 --> 17:08.380
My lord! My lord!

17:11.500 --> 17:13.160
Oh, gods!

17:13.160 --> 17:15.000
Hurry! Don't fall behind!

17:15.000 --> 17:18.110
Follow me! It's a monster outbreak!

17:18.110 --> 17:19.940
Follow me! Follow me!

17:21.580 --> 17:23.790
There. That should do it.

17:23.790 --> 17:24.560
Move!

17:26.560 --> 17:30.060
Follow me! Follow me! Follow me!

17:33.530 --> 17:35.310
What in the world is this?!

17:35.960 --> 17:37.630
A crater?!

17:38.780 --> 17:40.020
It doesn't make sense...

17:40.020 --> 17:44.250
I've been using Search, but there
aren't any signs of monsters.

17:44.250 --> 17:46.780
Then who's responsible for—

17:55.250 --> 17:56.630
Air Bullet!

17:59.750 --> 18:01.860
He's as insane as ever today.

18:02.150 --> 18:05.190
I can't believe Cain is
still only eight years old.

18:05.190 --> 18:07.580
He's far stronger than both of us.

18:07.580 --> 18:11.720
We say goodbye today... It's a little sad.

18:12.110 --> 18:15.490
Maestra Millie! Maestra Nina!

18:15.490 --> 18:17.110
I'm done!

18:17.550 --> 18:19.400
It's done, indeed...

18:22.070 --> 18:23.170
Cain...

18:23.850 --> 18:25.360
This is your graduation.

18:27.010 --> 18:29.260
You've done very well
these past three years.

18:30.020 --> 18:34.330
Maestra Millie, Maestra Nina,
thank you so much.

18:34.330 --> 18:37.580
Um, I hope you'll accept these.

18:37.890 --> 18:42.290
I made them with all my gratitude
to thank you for all you've done.

18:43.200 --> 18:44.310
What are they?

18:44.310 --> 18:47.390
They're Magic Bags. I made them myself.

18:47.390 --> 18:49.890
You said you wanted one, Maestra Millie.

18:50.220 --> 18:51.740
You <i>made</i> them?

18:51.740 --> 18:53.430
And the materials...

18:53.430 --> 18:54.060
Yes!

18:54.670 --> 18:56.650
The red one came from a blood ogre,

18:56.650 --> 18:58.590
and the green one came from an earth dragon.

18:58.590 --> 19:00.140
A blood ogre...

19:00.140 --> 19:01.540
...and an earth dragon?!

19:01.860 --> 19:03.030
Hang on a second!

19:03.330 --> 19:08.530
Those are both monsters that a full party
of A-rank adventurers can barely take down!

19:08.530 --> 19:11.050
And an eight-year-old child did it alone?!

19:11.050 --> 19:12.510
Well, he's Cain.

19:12.510 --> 19:13.530
Oh, right!

19:13.760 --> 19:15.950
You don't need to worry, though.

19:15.950 --> 19:18.000
The materials may look different,

19:18.000 --> 19:21.110
but they're regular Magic Bags on the inside.

19:21.110 --> 19:23.550
And I made it so they don't hold too much.

19:23.550 --> 19:24.570
Not too much?

19:24.570 --> 19:25.680
Yes, that's right.

19:25.950 --> 19:29.010
It would just barely fit
our mansion, I think.

19:29.010 --> 19:31.190
Whoa, Cain!

19:31.190 --> 19:36.850
The Magic Bag I was gonna buy would
only hold about two carriages!

19:36.850 --> 19:37.540
Huh?!

19:37.540 --> 19:40.440
And it's something you have to
save up a ton of money to buy!

19:40.440 --> 19:44.720
Y-You mean a Magic Bag of this class...

19:44.720 --> 19:47.320
...is definitely national-treasure class.

19:47.320 --> 19:49.730
N-National treasure?!

19:49.730 --> 19:50.900
I blew it!

19:50.900 --> 19:53.670
And if we carry national treasures around...

19:54.780 --> 19:57.090
All kinds of people will come after us.

19:57.330 --> 19:59.540
No! You don't need to worry about that!

19:59.540 --> 20:03.100
I made them so that if anyone
but the three of us holds them,

20:03.100 --> 20:05.270
they'll be as heavy as
everything held inside them!

20:06.400 --> 20:09.090
That's even beyond
national-treasure class...

20:09.920 --> 20:12.350
I blew it even worse!

20:12.650 --> 20:15.330
But are you sure about this, Cain?

20:15.760 --> 20:18.410
We didn't even teach you that much.

20:18.410 --> 20:21.270
No, that's not true.

20:21.270 --> 20:24.620
I learned all kinds of
things from both of you.

20:24.910 --> 20:27.970
Like how good a packed lunch tastes
when you eat it outside...

20:27.970 --> 20:29.830
How precious friends are...

20:29.830 --> 20:32.320
And how much fun adventuring is—

20:43.790 --> 20:45.220
See you, Cain.

20:45.220 --> 20:48.970
If you ever want our help after
you grow up, let us know.

20:48.970 --> 20:51.630
Yeah. We'll be there anytime.

20:52.140 --> 20:53.250
Thank you.

20:53.740 --> 20:55.720
We had fun, too.

20:56.060 --> 20:59.510
Maestra Millie... Maestra Nina...

21:00.000 --> 21:03.240
Thank you for teaching me for so long!

21:08.750 --> 21:12.770
With that, their contract period ended,

21:13.210 --> 21:16.360
and I grew up just a little bit more.

22:48.950 --> 22:50.360
Oh, Father.

22:50.360 --> 22:53.650
This was on the ground where
the forest was blown up.

22:53.650 --> 22:56.740
I had Sylvia confirm it. This is yours!

22:57.370 --> 23:00.360
Care to explain what this is all about?

23:00.360 --> 23:03.880
I led the troops out thinking
it was a monster outbreak!

23:03.880 --> 23:05.600
What did you do?!

23:05.600 --> 23:09.230
I just used intermediate magic to fight
a blood ogre and an earth dragon...

23:09.230 --> 23:10.320
Are you kidding me?!

23:11.030 --> 23:13.670
You're only eight years old!

23:13.670 --> 23:16.020
You need to know your limits!

23:16.020 --> 23:16.950
I'm sorry.

23:17.220 --> 23:20.230
Just imagine if either of those
monsters came into the city!

23:20.230 --> 23:22.120
Just one of them would flatten it!

23:22.120 --> 23:23.040
I'm sorry.

23:23.040 --> 23:26.060
Do you realize how much
I've done to protect this city?!

23:26.060 --> 23:26.560
I'm sorry.

23:26.560 --> 23:27.450
You need to be more self-aware, Cain!
I'm sorry.

23:27.450 --> 23:29.580
You need to be more self-aware, Cain!

23:29.580 --> 23:29.790
I'm sorry.
You need to be more self-aware, Cain!

23:29.790 --> 23:31.280
I don't want to nag, but you're forcing me to!
I'm sorry.

23:31.280 --> 23:32.990
I don't want to nag, but you're forcing me to!

23:32.990 --> 23:34.560
I'm sorry.

23:35.440 --> 23:36.670
Nina, it's all you!

23:36.670 --> 23:37.670
I'm on it.

23:37.670 --> 23:39.690
Next time, "To the Royal Capital."
